      "statusChangeID": "60ca4e86ec714453d7f25240",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Partially addressed in 1105.\nWhen making a new instance of a world that has *no existing instances*, the default instance that the UI creates for you will match your \"saved\" region.\nHowever, if *any instances already exist* that you can access, the Go button will instead point to that existing instance.\nThis is intended behavior and by design.",
